WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:19.476
"Ugh! You won again!" Cora said. "No fair!"

2
00:00:19.477 --> 00:00:23.467
Cora and Mo were playing sea glass checkers.

3
00:00:23.468 --> 00:00:26.015
Cora loved playing checkers.

4
00:00:26.016 --> 00:00:30.640
She especially loved to win!

5
00:00:30.641 --> 00:00:32.762
Mo frowned.

6
00:00:32.763 --> 00:00:39.687
"We're just playing for fun, Cora."

7
00:00:39.688 --> 00:00:42.650
Cora started to set up the pieces again.

8
00:00:42.651 --> 00:00:47.782
"Let's play again. I'll win this time!"

9
00:00:47.783 --> 00:00:51.150
"You're being rude, Cora," Mo said.

10
00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:55.291
"I just like playing!" Cora said.

11
00:00:55.292 --> 00:00:58.970
Suddenly a new fish swam over.

12
00:00:58.971 --> 00:01:02.744
"Welcome to Rainbow Reef!" Mo said.

13
00:01:02.745 --> 00:01:07.579
The fish looked around.

14
00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:11.324
"This is a nice place," he said.

15
00:01:11.325 --> 00:01:15.105
Cora waved but didn't say anything.

16
00:01:15.106 --> 00:01:19.595
She was still setting up the pieces.

17
00:01:19.596 --> 00:01:23.138
"You're being rude," Mo whispered.

18
00:01:23.139 --> 00:01:27.720
Cora shrugged. "I'll go first."

19
00:01:27.721 --> 00:01:31.563
She moved a piece of sea glass.

20
00:01:31.564 --> 00:01:34.251
Three more fish arrived.

21
00:01:34.252 --> 00:01:38.977
"Hello," Mo said.

22
00:01:38.978 --> 00:01:42.357
He made his first move.

23
00:01:42.358 --> 00:01:47.623
Then more fish swam into the reef.

24
00:01:47.624 --> 00:01:50.774
Cora stared at the board.

25
00:01:50.775 --> 00:01:57.977
"Where should I move next?" she thought.

26
00:01:57.978 --> 00:02:01.604
A fish bumped into Cora.

27
00:02:01.605 --> 00:02:05.062
Sea glass pieces slid off the board.

28
00:02:05.063 --> 00:02:07.252
Cora spun around.

29
00:02:07.253 --> 00:02:11.461
"Whoa," she said.

30
00:02:11.462 --> 00:02:18.261
The reef was crowded with new fish!

